{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"close_class":"not_a_bug","close_reason":"Disproven by direct check: all ticket content reached origin/tickets, including this ticket's own commits, while it was open. I misread rev-list --count origin/tickets..HEAD as unpushed work; that count includes local merge topology even when content has landed. rebar doctor and tracker-maintenance --status both reported the store healthy and I overrode them with a hand-rolled metric.","current_status":"open","parent_status_uuid":null,"status":"closed"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"STATUS","parent_status_uuid":null,"timestamp":1787293626810968001,"uuid":"c2ce7a83-70af-48db-b7d8-07bd517d3668"}